    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec11",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 132,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "How each dish is made",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "做法",
      "zh-Hans": "做法"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t12",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 42.8,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Fries: deep fryer, overnight. 1 nutrifruit.\nFried chicken: deep fryer, overnight. 1 piece of meat.\nMeat burger: food processor, \"Burger\". Meat + nutrifruit (bun) + fillerweed.\nSuper combo: food processor, \"Combo\". Burger + fries + fried chicken.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "薯条：油锅，过一夜。营养果 ×1。\n炸鸡：油锅，过一夜。肉 ×1。\n肉汉堡：食品加工器，点“做汉堡”。肉 + 营养果（面包胚）+ 填料草。\n超级大套餐：食品加工器，点“配套餐”。汉堡 + 薯条 + 炸鸡。",
      "zh-Hans": "薯条：油锅，过一夜。营养果 ×1。\n炸鸡：油锅，过一夜。肉 ×1。\n肉汉堡：食品加工器，点“做汉堡”。肉 + 营养果（面包胚）+ 填料草。\n超级大套餐：食品加工器，点“配套餐”。汉堡 + 薯条 + 炸鸡。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar13",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#b5793a",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 200.8,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec14",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 200.8,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Quality",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "品质",
      "zh-Hans": "品质"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t15",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 220.8,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Every dish scores 0-100 points in five grades, up to Michelin at +200%. Points come from the meat's calories, oil purity, the burger's ingredient ratio and the machine's quality modules. See the last page.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "每份菜 0–100 分，分五档，最高米其林，价格 +200%。分数看肉的千卡、油的纯净度、汉堡的食材比例和机器上的品质模组。详见最后一页。",
      "zh-Hans": "每份菜 0–100 分，分五档，最高米其林，价格 +200%。分数看肉的千卡、油的纯净度、汉堡的食材比例和机器上的品质模组。详见最后一页。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t16",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 255.4,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 12.2,
     "color": "#4d5a73",
     "text": "Hover over a dish to see its grade and points.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "鼠标指着菜能看到档次和得分。",
      "zh-Hans": "鼠标指着菜能看到档次和得分。"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
