     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 104,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Setting up",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "准备",
      "zh-Hans": "准备"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t21",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 124,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Put a container of cooking oil in the \"Oil\" slot: the cooking oil jug, or any of the game's jugs and bottles you poured oil into. It needs at least 1 L, and no water in it. Put a battery in the power slot.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "“油桶”槽放一桶食用油：食用油桶，或者倒了油的游戏里任何桶、瓶子都行。至少 1 L，油里不能有水。电源槽放电池。",
      "zh-Hans": "“油桶”槽放一桶食用油：食用油桶，或者倒了油的游戏里任何桶、瓶子都行。至少 1 L，油里不能有水。电源槽放电池。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar22",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#b5793a",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 162.6,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec23",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 162.6,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Frying",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "炸",
      "zh-Hans": "炸"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t24",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 182.6,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Put nutrifruit and meat in the basket and sleep. Each night everything in the basket is fried into the output: nutrifruit → fries, meat → fried chicken. Each portion soaks up 100 ml of oil; one night uses 20 charge.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "炸篮放营养果和肉，睡一觉。每晚把炸篮里的东西炸好放进出锅格：营养果 → 薯条，肉 → 炸鸡。每份吸掉 100 ml 油，每晚耗 20 电。",
      "zh-Hans": "炸篮放营养果和肉，睡一觉。每晚把炸篮里的东西炸好放进出锅格：营养果 → 薯条，肉 → 炸鸡。每份吸掉 100 ml 油，每晚耗 20 电。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar25",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#4d5a73",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 221.2,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec26",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 221.2,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Modules",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "模组",
      "zh-Hans": "模组"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t27",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 241.2,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 22.4,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "The fryer has the game's standard module grid. Quality modules raise the score: +100% quality gives the full 20 points.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "油锅有游戏标准的模组格。品质模组加分：品质加成 +100% 拿满 20 分。",
      "zh-Hans": "油锅有游戏标准的模组格。品质模组加分：品质加成 +100% 拿满 20 分。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t28",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 265.59999999999997,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 22.4,
     "color": "#4d5a73",
     "text": "Hover over the fryer to see the oil in it and how many portions it can still fry.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "鼠标指着油锅能看到里面的油，还能炸几份。",
      "zh-Hans": "鼠标指着油锅能看到里面的油，还能炸几份。"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
