    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec32",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 104,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Burger",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "做汉堡",
      "zh-Hans": "做汉堡"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t33",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 124,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Put meat, nutrifruit and fillerweed in \"Ingredients\" and click \"Burger\" in the title bar: everything in the grid becomes one burger. It needs at least meat and nutrifruit. Each click uses 5 charge.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "“食材”格放肉、营养果、填料草，点标题栏的“做汉堡”：格子里的全部食材做成一个汉堡。至少要有肉和营养果。每按一次耗 5 电。",
      "zh-Hans": "“食材”格放肉、营养果、填料草，点标题栏的“做汉堡”：格子里的全部食材做成一个汉堡。至少要有肉和营养果。每按一次耗 5 电。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t34",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 158.6,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 22.4,
     "color": "#8a3b4a",
     "text": "The ratio is counted in calories. Ideal: meat 55% : nutrifruit 30% : fillerweed 15%. The message after each burger shows your ratio.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "比例按千卡算，理想是 肉 55% : 营养果 30% : 填料草 15%。每做一个汉堡，提示里会写出这次的比例。",
      "zh-Hans": "比例按千卡算，理想是 肉 55% : 营养果 30% : 填料草 15%。每做一个汉堡，提示里会写出这次的比例。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t35",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 183.0,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 22.4,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Example: standard raw meat (1200) + 2 nutrifruit (480) + fillerweed (259) = 62 : 25 : 13.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "例：标准生肉（1200）+ 营养果 ×2（480）+ 填料草（259）= 62 : 25 : 13。",
      "zh-Hans": "例：标准生肉（1200）+ 营养果 ×2（480）+ 填料草（259）= 62 : 25 : 13。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar36",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#b5793a",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 211.4,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec37",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 211.4,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Super combo",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "配套餐",
      "zh-Hans": "配套餐"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t38",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 231.4,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 22.4,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Put a burger, fries and fried chicken in \"Plating\" and click \"Combo\". The combo's grade is the lowest of the three.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "“配餐”格放汉堡、薯条、炸鸡各一份，点“配套餐”。套餐的档次取三样里最低的。",
      "zh-Hans": "“配餐”格放汉堡、薯条、炸鸡各一份，点“配套餐”。套餐的档次取三样里最低的。"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
