     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Oil gets dirty",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "油会变脏",
      "zh-Hans": "油会变脏"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t44",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 124,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Each night of frying leaves large crumbs and fine residue in the oil, and 4% of the cooking oil turns into aged oil. Oil purity = the share of cooking oil in the container.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "每炸一晚，油里会多出大颗粒炸渣和小颗粒油渣，还有 4% 的食用油变成老化油。油的纯净度 = 食用油在桶里占的比例。",
      "zh-Hans": "每炸一晚，油里会多出大颗粒炸渣和小颗粒油渣，还有 4% 的食用油变成老化油。油的纯净度 = 食用油在桶里占的比例。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar45",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#3f6f73",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 162.6,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec46",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 162.6,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Filtering",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "过滤",
      "zh-Hans": "过滤"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t47",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 182.6,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 53.0,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "1. Put the oil strainer in a water pitcher and pour the oil in: the large crumbs stay behind.\n2. Swap in a water filter and pour the oil through again: the fine residue stays behind.\nFiltered oil is \"recycled oil\".",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "1. 滤油网装进滤水壶，把油倒进去：大颗粒炸渣被滤掉。\n2. 换成滤水器，再倒一遍：小颗粒油渣被滤掉。\n滤过的油叫“二次食用油”。",
      "zh-Hans": "1. 滤油网装进滤水壶，把油倒进去：大颗粒炸渣被滤掉。\n2. 换成滤水器，再倒一遍：小颗粒油渣被滤掉。\n滤过的油叫“二次食用油”。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t48",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 237.6,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 12.2,
     "color": "#8a3b4a",
     "text": "Large crumbs also clog a water filter fast, so strain first.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "大颗粒也能用滤水器滤，但很伤滤嘴，先用滤油网。",
      "zh-Hans": "大颗粒也能用滤水器滤，但很伤滤嘴，先用滤油网。"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "bar49",
     "sprite": "notebook_manual_section",
     "fit": "stretch",
     "color": "#4d5a73",
     "x": 31,
     "y": 255.79999999999998,
     "w": 261,
     "h": 14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "sec50",
     "style": "label",
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "middle",
     "wrap": false,
     "x": 37,
     "y": 255.79999999999998,
     "w": 249,
     "h": 14,
     "color": "#f4f1e6",
     "text": "Good to know",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "注意",
      "zh-Hans": "注意"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "t51",
     "style": "body",
     "align": "left",
     "x": 35,
     "y": 275.79999999999995,
     "w": 253,
     "h": 32.599999999999994,
     "color": "#2b2733",
     "text": "Aged oil can't be filtered, so recycled oil never gets back to 100%; pouring in fresh oil brings it back up. No water in the oil, or the fryer won't use it. Spent oil can be poured down the drain.",
     "translations": {
      "zh": "老化油滤不掉，所以二次食用油回不到 100%；倒新油进去能拉回来。油里不能混水，否则油锅不用。不要的油倒进下水口。",
      "zh-Hans": "老化油滤不掉，所以二次食用油回不到 100%；倒新油进去能拉回来。油里不能混水，否则油锅不用。不要的油倒进下水口。"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
